%% title: Skip publishing an unchanged render
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant R as compiler binary
    participant O as ghcr
    S->>R: render this Project
    R-->>S: render, digest
    S->>O: digest behind render/#lt#59;p#gt#59;:prod?
    O-->>S: current digest
    alt same digest
        S->>S: publish nothing, move nothing, record why
    else different digest
        S->>O: push, sign, move the tag after the dry-run
    end
